@page "/"

<PageTitle>Clarity Belongs - Keep an eye on what matters</PageTitle>

<div class="shell public-shell">
    <section class="public-hero public-hero-grid">
        <div class="hero-copy">
            <div class="eyebrow">CLARITY BELONGS</div>
            <h1>Tell Clarity what matters. We keep an eye on it.</h1>
            <p class="public-lead">Websites, domains, prices, companies, public notices, opportunities, services and more. Clarity checks them over time, remembers what it saw, and tells you when something worth knowing changes.</p>
            <div class="action-row public-actions">
                <AuthorizeView>
                    <Authorized>
                        <a class="button" href="/add">Watch something</a>
                        <a class="button secondary" href="/my-clarity">Open My Clarity</a>
                    </Authorized>
                    <NotAuthorized>
                        <a class="button" href="/signup">Start free</a>
                        <a class="button secondary" href="/products">See what Clarity can watch</a>
                    </NotAuthorized>
                </AuthorizeView>
            </div>
            <p class="microcopy">Start with five things for free. No card required.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-visual" aria-label="Example Clarity activity">
            <div class="hero-visual-topline">
                <span class="status-dot"></span>
                <span>Clarity is watching</span>
                <span class="hero-live-pill">Live</span>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-watch-card hero-watch-card-featured">
                <div class="watch-icon">↗</div>
                <div>
                    <small>Something changed</small>
                    <strong>Pricing page updated</strong>
                    <span>Before and after saved</span>
                </div>
                <span class="watch-state changed">Changed</span>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-watch-card">
                <div class="watch-icon">✓</div>
                <div>
                    <small>Still healthy</small>
                    <strong>softwarebelongs.com</strong>
                    <span>Checked 2 minutes ago</span>
                </div>
                <span class="watch-state healthy">Healthy</span>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-watch-card">
                <div class="watch-icon">◷</div>
                <div>
                    <small>Needs attention soon</small>
                    <strong>Certificate renewal</strong>
                    <span>14 days remaining</span>
                </div>
                <span class="watch-state reminder">Reminder</span>
            </div>
            <p>One calm place instead of checking everything yourself.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="public-section idea-section">
        <div class="section-intro">
            <div class="eyebrow">HOW IT WORKS</div>
            <h2>You choose the thing. Clarity handles the watching.</h2>
            <p>You should not need to understand monitoring technology or pick from dozens of monitor types. Start with what you care about and Clarity uses the right checks underneath.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flow-grid">
            <div><strong>1</strong><span>Tell us what matters</span></div>
            <div><strong>2</strong><span>Clarity checks it</span></div>
            <div><strong>3</strong><span>History builds quietly</span></div>
            <div><strong>4</strong><span>See what changed</span></div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="public-section monitor-section">
        <div class="section-heading">
            <div>
                <div class="eyebrow">WHAT CAN CLARITY WATCH?</div>
                <h2>Start with the thing you care about.</h2>
            </div>
            <a href="/products">Browse all capabilities</a>
        </div>
        <div class="product-grid public-product-grid">
            <a class="product-card monitor-card" href="/add">
                <div class="monitor-icon">◎</div>
                <div class="eyebrow">WEBSITES & DOMAINS</div>
                <h2>My website</h2>
                <p>Watch uptime, changes, SSL, domain expiration and DNS together instead of configuring each one separately.</p>
                <span class="monitor-link">Watch a website →</span>
            </a>
            <a class="product-card monitor-card" href="/products">
                <div class="monitor-icon">$</div>
                <div class="eyebrow">PRICES & AVAILABILITY</div>
                <h2>Something I may buy</h2>
                <p>Keep a history of a public price or availability source and know when it changes.</p>
                <span class="monitor-link">See price watches →</span>
            </a>
            <a class="product-card monitor-card" href="/products">
                <div class="monitor-icon">↗</div>
                <div class="eyebrow">COMPANIES & CHANGES</div>
                <h2>A company or service</h2>
                <p>Keep an eye on public pages, pricing, releases, policies, status information and other useful changes.</p>
                <span class="monitor-link">See company watches →</span>
            </a>
            <a class="product-card monitor-card" href="/products">
                <div class="monitor-icon">!</div>
                <div class="eyebrow">PUBLIC INFORMATION</div>
                <h2>A notice or opportunity</h2>
                <p>Watch public meetings, filings, recalls, deadlines, local projects and other information you do not want to keep checking manually.</p>
                <span class="monitor-link">See public watches →</span>
            </a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="public-section split-callout">
        <div>
            <div class="eyebrow">MY CLARITY</div>
            <h2>Everything you asked us to keep an eye on.</h2>
            <p>My Clarity is your personal view of what needs attention, what changed recently, what is still healthy, and the history Clarity has built for you.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mock-feed">
            <div><span class="badge">Changed</span><strong>Pricing page updated</strong><small>Before and after saved</small></div>
            <div><span class="badge">Recovered</span><strong>Website responding again</strong><small>4 minutes ago</small></div>
            <div><span class="badge">Reminder</span><strong>SSL expires in 14 days</strong><small>Worth handling soon</small></div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="public-section ecosystem-section">
        <div class="section-intro">
            <div class="eyebrow">HOW CLARITY FITS</div>
            <h2>Software Belongs helps you do. Clarity helps you know.</h2>
            <p>Software Belongs gives people useful tools. Clarity keeps watch over things that change over time. AutoPilot IT brings the same self-service philosophy to business technology.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ecosystem-grid">
            <a href="https://softwarebelongs.com"><strong>Software Belongs</strong><span>DO — useful tools that help you act.</span></a>
            <div class="ecosystem-current"><strong>Clarity Belongs</strong><span>KNOW — keep an eye on what matters.</span></div>
            <div><strong>AutoPilot IT</strong><span>HANDLE — self-service technology for business.</span></div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="public-cta">
        <div class="eyebrow">STOP CHECKING</div>
        <h2>Give Clarity something to keep an eye on.</h2>
        <p>Start with one website, domain, price, company, notice, opportunity or service. Clarity builds the history from there.</p>
        <AuthorizeView>
            <Authorized>
                <a class="button" href="/add">Watch something</a>
            </Authorized>
            <NotAuthorized>
                <a class="button" href="/signup">Start free</a>
            </NotAuthorized>
        </AuthorizeView>
    </section>
</div>
